        "Body": {
          "ContentType": "html",
          "Content": "<div><p>Now you can install the credcheck extension in Azure\nDatabase for PostgreSQL Flexible Server. The credcheck extension helps you to\nenforce password and credential validation policies directly within PostgreSQL.\n&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/postgresql/extensions/concepts-extensions-versions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn\nmore</a>.&nbsp;</p><br></div>",
          "Markdown": "Now you can install the credcheck extension in Azure\n\nDatabase for PostgreSQL Flexible Server. The credcheck extension helps you to\n\nenforce password and credential validation policies directly within PostgreSQL.\n\nLearn\n\nmore ."
